{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"pick","model_identifier":"pick","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## pick\n\nWorker tool, metal tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.0..1.0, y -9.5..9.5, z -25.5..4.5 (size 2.0 x 19.0 x 30.0 u = 6 x 53 x 84 cm).\nMetal two-ended pick (copper, bronze, iron grades, steel), 75 cm handle (28 u). Grip at the origin 3.5 u from the butt, head 24 u forward (-Z), points down (-Y, the working point) and up (+Y). One-handed swing; two-handed second grip 8 u forward.\n- Embedded texture: copper. Tier textures: copper, bronze, iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `pick_copper.png`, `pick_bronze.png`, `pick_iron_bloom.png`, `pick_iron_wrought.png`, `pick_iron_refined.png`, `pick_steel.png`, `pick_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## pick\n\nWorker tool, metal tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.0..1.0, y -9.5..9.5, z -25.5..4.5 (size 2.0 x 19.0 x 30.0 u = 6 x 53 x 84 cm).\nMetal two-ended pick (copper, bronze, iron grades, steel), 75 cm handle (28 u). Grip at the origin 3.5 u from the butt, head 24 u forward (-Z), points down (-Y, the working point) and up (+Y). One-handed swing; two-handed second grip 8 u forward.\n- Embedded texture: copper. Tier textures: copper, bronze, iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `pick_copper.png`, `pick_bronze.png`, `pick_iron_bloom.png`, `pick_iron_wrought.png`, `pick_iron_refined.png`, `pick_steel.png`, `pick_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"handle","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-0